<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Yasin says IMF talks difficult.</title>
<headline>Russia's Yasin says IMF talks difficult.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economy Minister Yevgeny Yasin said on Thursday that talks with the International Monetary Fund were proving difficult.</p>
<p>&quot;The situation is difficult. We have problems and there will be certain problems with 1997,&quot; he told a news conference when asked about the progress of the IMF talks.</p>
</text>
